WEBVTT

00:13:58.145 --> 00:14:00.363
without counting the cost,

00:14:00.387 --> 00:14:04.588
without reasons and assurances
that nothing will be lost.

00:14:05.143 --> 00:14:07.304
Life will break your heart,

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:10.763
and life may take everything you have

00:14:10.787 --> 00:14:12.524
and everything you hope for.

00:14:13.063 --> 00:14:17.309
But there is one kind
of prosperity gospel that I believe in.

00:14:17.868 --> 00:14:20.236
I believe that in the darkness,

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.791
even there,

00:14:21.815 --> 00:14:23.613
there will be beauty,

00:14:23.637 --> 00:14:25.318
and there will be love.

00:14:25.342 --> 00:14:27.825
And every now and then,

00:14:27.849 --> 00:14:30.886
it will feel like more than enough.